  "details": "\"Haha, I blocked myself.\"\n\nDevice: Samsung S24 Ultra\n\nBrowsers: Chrome, and Adblock Browser\n\nSteps to repro:\n\n1. Block a user via the website, OR view the profile of a user that you already have blocked\n\n2. Go back to your own profile page\n\n3. You can see that you have a blocked icon against yourself\n\nRefreshing the page will remove the blocked icon. Repeating the steps above will trigger the bug.",
